Scope
=====

The MIT license below applies to the slimthesis template: the style
slimthesis.sty, the file main.tex, the example chapters and front matter,
the documentation, and the other files of the template, except those listed
under "Exclusions".

Theses and other documents produced with the template belong to their
authors and are not subject to this license.

Exclusions
==========

The following files are distributed with the template but are not covered
by the MIT license, and remain subject to their own terms:

- images/coverPage/logo_informatica.jpg,
  images/coverPage/logo_informatica_magistrale.jpg,
  images/coverPage/logo_unimi.jpg: logos and trademarks of the Università
  degli Studi di Milano, whose use is governed by the rules of the
  University.

- images/coverPage/slim-logo.png: logo of the SLIM laboratory, Università
  degli Studi di Milano; all rights reserved.

- images/license/cc-*.pdf: buttons of the Creative Commons licenses,
  trademarks of Creative Commons, to be used to mark the license of a work
  (https://creativecommons.org/policies).

- fonts/Figtree/*.ttf: the Figtree font, Copyright 2022 The Figtree Project
  Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (see
  fonts/Figtree/OFL.txt).

